flowchart TD
    Start([Chat request]) --> Budget{Enough time for transport?}
    Budget -- No --> Partial[Return PARTIAL timeout]
    Budget -- Yes --> Primary[Call primary model through CLI Proxy]
    Primary --> Result{Request succeeds?}
    Result -- Yes --> Return[Return text or tool calls]
    Result -- No --> FallbackBudget{Enough time for fallback?}
    FallbackBudget -- No --> Partial
    FallbackBudget -- Yes --> Fallback[Call fallback model through the same CLI Proxy]
    Fallback --> Status{Request succeeds?}
    Status -- Yes --> Return
    Status -- No --> Error[Raise proxy exception]
